  "id": "developmental-assessment",
  "term": "developmental assessment",
  "definition": "Developmental assessment is the evaluation of a child’s development using methods such as parent-completed questionnaires and individualized developmental scales. It is used to examine how a child is developing in areas such as language and social functioning, often by comparing developmental level with age or with other reference data.",
